Changelog: 14-11-2026 13:51:12

Added. Starting Nexus Dashboard while it is open closes the open window and opens a new one, with the checkout's
code as it is now. It brought the open window to the front. The open dashboard is asked to close; one that does not
answer within 5 seconds is ended. Two starts at the same moment (a double-click) still give one window.

